Package: bloodspottR
Title: Calibrated Histology Burden and Erythrocyte Profile Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for physically calibrated histology burden
 summaries, explicit measurement-area accounting, and tissue-aware spatial
 analysis. Supports reproducible development of red-chromogen and
 erythrocyte-profile workflows. Image-derived candidates require independent
 validation before biological interpretation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See file inst/COPYRIGHTS for the bundled 'OpenSeadragon'
 library.
